# What .agents/setup installs from, besides itself. A change to any of these
# files at a thread's commit makes the project's machine template stale: that
# thread runs setup itself and the next one builds a new template
# (docs/project-hooks.md, "Setup inputs").
#
# Not listed: packages/web, which setup only builds into packages/web/dist.
# It changes several times a day, and everything that serves or tests the
# build runs `pnpm build` first (scripts/test-browser.sh, verify-cube).
package.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml
rust-toolchain.toml
scripts/setup-browsers.sh
